The '''Nether Artifact''' is an {{Epic}} [[Accessories|Accessory]] obtained through the [[Dark Auction]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Dark Auction ===
The '''Nether Artifact''' can be purchased from the [[Dark Auction]] rounds 1, 3 or 4 with starting bid of {{c|10000000}}. It has an overall {{Green|32.477%}} chance to appear.

== Usage ==
{{ItemInfo
|type = Accessory
|rarity = epic
|special_effect = Reduces the damage taken by {{mt|Infernal}} mobs by 5%. <br> While in the {{Zone|Crimson Isle}}, you will receive the damage reduction from all [[Mobs]].
}}

